questions.q:
For all real values of \(\theta\), the matrix product
\[
\begin{bmatrix} \cos\theta & \sin\theta \end{bmatrix}
\begin{bmatrix} 6 & 2 \\ 2 & 3 \end{bmatrix}
\begin{bmatrix} \cos\theta \\ \sin\theta \end{bmatrix}
\]
evaluates to a \(1 \times 1\) matrix \([k]\). What is the maximum possible value of \(k\)?
